## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Observation Lab (M4 unified client-observation lab)
## Notes: Consolidated, modular successor to the one-off M3/M4 probes (ForeverProbe, ForeverProbeM4, ForeverProbeM4Retry, ForeverProbeM4Rep), which remain frozen historical evidence and are untouched by this addon. Read-only. Never accepts/completes/turns in quests. Never calls GetQuestReward(). Proven modules (quest ID/title/level/objectives, XP, money, item rewards, reputation, giver identity, gossip) run automatically. Experimental modules (currency, spell, title, honor rewards, faction-name resolution) are disabled by default -- enable per-session with /flab enable <Module>.
